cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
title: "MOVE Faults / Philippine Open Geodesy Framework (POGF)"
abstract: >-
  An open, reproducible pipeline for the Philippine national GNSS networks:
  Bernese GNSS Software orchestration for campaign and continuous data, RINEX
  quality control, coordinate-to-ENU time series, offset-aware velocity
  estimation verified against PHIVOLCS' production output, real-time VADASE
  displacement monitoring, and an offline-first field logsheet application.
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: Pelicano
    given-names: Alfie
    affiliation: >-
      Philippine Institute of Volcanology and Seismology (PHIVOLCS),
      Department of Science and Technology (DOST)
repository-code: "https://github.com/alfieprojectsdev/movefaults"
license: MIT
version: 0.1.0
keywords:
  - GNSS
  - geodesy
  - crustal deformation
  - Bernese GNSS Software
  - RINEX
  - earthquake monitoring
  - Philippines
  - reproducible research
